# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVACY: everything client-, job- or SDK-related stays local.
#
# private/ holds the Adobe SDKs (AE + Premiere headers are marked ADOBE
# CONFIDENTIAL and must never be published), plus any note, probe script or
# captured frame that references real client work. Same convention as the
# minColor repo. The Windows machine gets its own SDK copy from Adobe's
# developer site — the SDK does NOT travel through this repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
private/

# Debug frame dumps — client pixels. Never committed, never in the project tree.
*.exr
*.dpx
captures/

